<p>Transylvania is an actual place populated by actual humans with some actually pretty interesting history.</p>
<p>Here, as elsewhere, it is just &quot;le epic vampire country.&quot; If this was &quot;Ambrose - Dayton, Ohio, But There Are Vampires,&quot; I probably would no-vote and move on. This chooses the most generic &quot;insert spooky stuff here&quot; setting imaginable, and doesn't do much with it. Everything feels perfunctory, like it's just going through the list of Vampire Stuff and checking boxes. The lack of a spark, combined with the bad taste in my mouth from the setting, made me fall on the downvote side.</p>
