<p>Greenlight - YES<br />
SCP Article<br />
Horror/ Psychological Horror<br />
Layout - Standard Scip article<br />
*Tunnel To Your Childhood*<br />
Elev Pitch - A migrating tunnel that manifests in tunnels where tragedies have occurred, when entered humans will see something from their childhood, something they always associated with good memories. This memory will manifest itself into a twisted physical form, and attack the victim. I want to have several MTF encounters and maybe a tale in the future about one encounter</p>
<p>Central - I want to have this be a staple in reality-bending SCP's and I'm going to work hard on this article, and I'm going to write some SCP's that link to this one in a way I haven't decided yet, and create a complex world of memory changers and reality benders</p>
<p>Hook - My article is going to be creating horrific visages of your favorite childhood memories, and I would appreciate your memories to be used for my article, and I'll do my damndest to make it worthy of a phobia.</p>
<p>Thank you to those reading, and please comment some memories for me to put a sick twist in :)</p>
<p>Horror, Extradimensional, Hostile, Inscribed, memory-affecting, metamorphic, mind-affecting, mobile, ontokinetic, ectoentropic, physics, portal, self-repairing, auditory, visual, spacetime, stone, tactile, telepathic, teleportation, transfiguration, uncontained,</p>

